FROM qdrant/qdrant:v1.19.2@sha256:b7b0444c4c351c970b98e90a6f89c2ee4287c65b44e52b4cb503fa5b2aa927ad AS qdrant
USER root
RUN mkdir -p /qdrant/storage /qdrant/snapshots
FROM busybox:1.36@sha256:73aaf090f3d85aa34ee199857f03fa3a95c8ede2ffd4cc2cdb5b94e566b11662 AS probe
FROM golang:1.26-alpine@sha256:3082400e369fa24d5fc60bca20edab3f6d604e0c5a690ec66b295eff4dd87ade AS healthcheck
WORKDIR /src
COPY qdrant-healthcheck.go .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GO111MODULE=off GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" -o /out/healthcheck qdrant-healthcheck.go
FROM gcr.io/distroless/cc-debian13:nonroot@sha256:e792ab3d241a468a4fd7519ddbbebe66b49b5f365771716ea688ad40b6c6f1c2

WORKDIR /qdrant
COPY --from=qdrant /qdrant/qdrant /qdrant/qdrant
COPY --from=qdrant --chown=65532:65532 /qdrant/config /qdrant/config
COPY --from=qdrant --chown=65532:65532 /qdrant/storage /qdrant/storage
COPY --from=qdrant --chown=65532:65532 /qdrant/snapshots /qdrant/snapshots
COPY --from=qdrant /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libunwind-ptrace.so.0 /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libunwind-ptrace.so.0
COPY --from=qdrant /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libunwind-x86_64.so.8 /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libunwind-x86_64.so.8
COPY --from=qdrant /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libunwind.so.8 /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/libunwind.so.8
COPY --from=qdrant /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/liblzma.so.5 /lib/x86_64-linux-gnu/liblzma.so.5
COPY --from=probe /bin/busybox /bin/busybox
COPY --from=healthcheck /out/healthcheck /qdrant/healthcheck

USER 65532:65532
HEALTHCHECK --interval=10s --timeout=3s --start-period=10s --retries=5 \
    CMD ["/qdrant/healthcheck"]
ENTRYPOINT ["/qdrant/qdrant"]
